## Typical Queries (Pseudocode)

**1) Get all clauses for a doc (ordered)**
```js
Query({
  TableName: "LegalDocs",
  KeyConditionExpression: "pk = :p AND begins_with(sk, :c)",
  ExpressionAttributeValues: { ":p": "DOC#LPA_FUND1_V1", ":c": "CLAUSE#" }
})
```

**2) All clauses under a topic (e.g., MFN)**
```js
Query({
  TableName: "LegalDocs",
  IndexName: "gsi1-by-term",
  KeyConditionExpression: "gsi1pk = :t",
  ExpressionAttributeValues: { ":t": "TERM#mfn" }
})
```

**3) All SL clauses for an investor**
```js
Query({
  TableName: "LegalDocs",
  IndexName: "gsi2-by-investor",
  KeyConditionExpression: "gsi2pk = :i",
  ExpressionAttributeValues: { ":i": "INV#INV100" }
})
```

**4) Reverse lookup: which SLs matched LPA §6.1(b)?**
```js
Query({
  TableName: "LegalDocs",
  IndexName: "gsi4-reverse-lpa-map",
  KeyConditionExpression: "gsi4pk = :k",
  ExpressionAttributeValues: { ":k": "LPA#LPA_FUND1_V1#CLAUSE#6.1(b)" }
})
```

**5) Build the comparison matrix for one SL**
```js
Query({
  TableName: "LegalDocs",
  KeyConditionExpression: "pk = :p",
  ExpressionAttributeValues: { ":p": "COMPARE#SL_INV100_FUND1_V1" }
})
```

